:: OC Shinju and Lucas Drama Conventions Intro [nobr]

/* Intro */
Drama class begins with a run through of breathing exercises. Common and routine in this class, <span style="color:Yellow">though made interesting by the fact that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> is positioned right next to his white-haired rival, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>. You watch in mild amusement as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>, always looking to get a reaction out of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>, pokes him in his lower back as he is breathing in, causing him to gasp and squirm.</span> While not really mean or threatening, you can see how that would be very annoying. Still, you smirk at the sight as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> whispers <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Stop it!”</span> to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span>. 

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Eyes: "Tired",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Lucas",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Eyes: "Mad",
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Shinju",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                Eyes: "Tired",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright class, now I want you all to pair up in small groups and we are going to work on scene 38. Remember, I want each of you to work on-”</span> You try to pay attention to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span>’s instructions, <span style="color:Yellow">but are distracted as both <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> grab you by either arm.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span>, I was here first.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> says with a smirk, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Too slow, too bad, so sad.”</span> He sticks his tongue out at an annoyed <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> who responds. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“This isn’t a first come first serve situation.”</span> He pulls you closer, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“<span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span> wants to partner up with me, so why don’t you run back to whatever cave you crawled out of.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hurtful.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> scoffs with a smirk. You try to explain that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> said small groups, meaning the three of you can all be together, but it falls on deaf ears. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alas, must be a shame to be a solo hero, without allies or comrades to rely upon. Truly a hero’s life is a solitary one. Not that I blame <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$Player.Name</span>, as you are a pretty pitiful hero to fight alongside, from what I’ve seen.”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Pitiful!?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> sounds more than a little offended, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“The only pitiful one here is you thinking he is some sort of demon or something and acting like he’s better than everyone else just because he plays pretend!”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">The back and forth continues, each boy moving closer and closer and getting more and more upset as you are stuck in the middle trying to defuse it. <br>
<br>
Just then, one of the boys, you’re not sure who, loses their balance.</span> A stray shoelace, a buckled knee, or maybe even intentional. <span style="color:LightCoral">You aren’t sure, but one thing leads to another and a tumble occurs. All three of you fall to the ground, rolling directly into a nearby set piece that had been set up for practice. <br>
<br>
CRASH! <br>
<br>
And the three of you are left on a heap on the floor, the scenery now in pieces beneath you.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Children!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> calls out in annoyance and anger, <span style="color:LightCoral">a strange emotion to hear from him.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I don’t recall putting a fight scene in the script! What has gotten into you!?”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">Both <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> jump to their feet, each shouting and blaming the other for the accident.</span> You just stand up and sigh as Julien shooshes them.

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Julien",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Brows: "Angry",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Frown",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Lucas",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "OC Shinju",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Uniform",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Blush: 1,
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Enough! I do not wish to hear it.”</span> He pinches the top of his nose in annoyance, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Detention for all three of you. You’ll be fixing the scenery and maybe that will help you understand that this is a place for art, not conflict! I swear, drama in Drama Class, who would have thought?!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> walks away as everyone else smirks and stares at you all until he calls for everyone to begin. <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Detention for all of us?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Lucas</span> says, turning red, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But that’s not fair! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$LucasNickname</span>, you didn’t even do anything! Here, let me go talk to-”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Classic hero, trying to do good but just going to make everything worse.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Shinju</span> interrupts him, shaking his head with a knowing smirk, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“All that is going to accomplish is getting our friend here in more trouble. You think <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> really wants to hear your excuses?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“This wouldn’t be happening if you hadn’t-!”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">The boys are about to go at it again when Julien yells out, telling the boys to separate and shut up unless they are reciting lines.</span> They both do so, looking kind of nervous at hearing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Mr. Julien</span> sounding so annoyed, and run off to new groups. <span style="color:Yellow">This leaves you alone trying to figure out how you got stuck in the middle of all this.</span> <br>
<<set $ActiveQuests.push("Shinju: Breaking Drama Conventions")>>
<<set $InActiveQuests.delete("Shinju: Breaking Drama Conventions")>>
<<set $Detention += 10>>
<<set $PlayerDramaFaithChange to "Decrease">>
<<set $LucasDramaFaithChange to "Decrease">>
<br>
<<include"Drama Faith Change">>
<<include"Attend Drama Finish">>
